<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="f76d2468-f027-473a-9751-33083e4211f4" version="4">
  <Properties>
    <Name>[COLOR:ResCultureLabelCS]STRUDELER'S CIVILIZATIONS: SERBIA[ICON_Bullet]1.2.2[ENDCOLOR]</Name>
    <Description>[COLOR:ResFoodLabelCS]~Version 1.2.2~[ENDCOLOR][NEWLINE][NEWLINE][COLOR:ResGoldLabelCS]Requires: GATHERING STORM and BYZANTIUM AND GAUL CIVILIZATION PACK.[ENDCOLOR][NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Play as the mighty Emperor of Serbs and Greeks, Stefan Dušan; in Sid Meier's Civilization VI.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]LEADER: Stefan Uros IV Dušan (Serbia, Byzantium, and Greece)[NEWLINE]LEADER AGENDA: Emperor of Serbs and Greeks[NEWLINE]-Likes Civilizations in a Golden Age.[NEWLINE]-Dislikes Civilizations in a Dark Age.[NEWLINE]LEADER TRAIT: Dušan's Code[NEWLINE]-All Historic Moments gain an additional +1 Era Score.[NEWLINE]-Gain the Alemannic Guard unique Unit.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]LEADER UNIT: Alemannic Guard[NEWLINE]-Replaces the Knight.[NEWLINE]-Adjacent levied Units gain +5 [ICON_Strength] Combat Strength.[NEWLINE]-Cost to levy City-State Units decreases by 10% [ICON_Gold] Gold for every Alemannic Guard during a [ICON_GLORY_GOLDEN_AGE] Golden Age.[NEWLINE]- +50% Flanking bonus during a [ICON_GLORY_NORMAL_AGE] Normal Age.[NEWLINE]- +1 [ICON_Envoy] Envoy token point per turn for every Alemannic Guard during a [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] Dark Age.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]CIVILIZATION: Serbia[NEWLINE]CIVILIZATION TRAIT: Sclaveni[NEWLINE]-Civilian Units gain +2 [ICON_Movement] Movement during a [ICON_GLORY_GOLDEN_AGE] Golden Age.[NEWLINE]-Cities gain +2 [ICON_Housing] Housing during a [ICON_GLORY_NORMAL_AGE] Normal Age.[NEWLINE]-Military or Religious Units gain +5 [ICON_Strength] Combat or [ICON_Religion] Religious Strength during a [ICON_GLORY_DARK_AGE] Dark Age.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]CIVILIZATION UNIT: Gusar[NEWLINE]-Replaces the Courser.[NEWLINE]-1 [ICON_Range] Range.[NEWLINE]-Can ranged attack when embarked.[NEWLINE]-Can melee attack on land.[NEWLINE]- +3 [ICON_Movement] Movement when embarked.[NEWLINE]-Adjacent naval units can Coastal Raid.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]CIVILIZATION IMPROVEMENT: Autocephalous Church[NEWLINE]- +1 [ICON_Housing] Housing and [ICON_Faith] Faith.[NEWLINE]- +2 Loyalty.[NEWLINE]- +2 [ICON_GreatProphet] Great Prophet points per turn.[NEWLINE]-Gain standard adjacency for various yields based on adjacent Specialty Districts, this becomes major adjacency with Nationalism.[NEWLINE]- +15 HP healing for friendly Religious Units on the tile that has not attacked during the turn.[NEWLINE]-A City can only have one Autocephalous Church.[NEWLINE]-Tiles with an Autocephalous Church cannot be swapped.[NEWLINE]-Cannot be built next to another Autocephalous Church.</Description>
    <Created>1762877060</Created>
    <Teaser>Play as the mighty Emperor of Serbs and Greeks, Stefan Uros IV Dušan; in Sid Meier's Civilization VI.</Teaser>
    <Authors>Strudeler</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>The Tart Society, Sailor Cat, Barbarian King, Leugi, Dartmor, TheCrazyScotsman</SpecialThanks>
    <CompatibleVersions>1.2,2.0</CompatibleVersions>
  </Properties>
